@wojtek-t 
We simulate the scenario of NTP server failure, In the scenario of NTP server failure, the time may jump to the future. When we repair the NTP server, the time will be corrected.
When the time jumps to the future and then jumps back, cacheWatcher will be cached in watchersBuckets and will not be recycled by gc. memory will leak. In large-scale clusters, memory leaks are fast, and kube-apiserver will oom after a few hours
